@metaxia/scriptures-source-stepbible-lexicon

This package includes lexicon data from STEPBible.org:

  TBESH - Translators Brief lexicon of Extended Strongs for Hebrew
  TBESG - Translators Brief lexicon of Extended Strongs for Greek
  TFLSJ - Translators Formatted full LSJ Bible lexicon

Data created by www.STEPBible.org based on work at Tyndale House Cambridge,
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Source: https://github.com/STEPBible/STEPBible-Data
(commit 52607753604a9a650b9ae62da8d069a8312eb99a)

Changes: the tab-separated files are converted to JSON. In the *-rows.json
files each row is keyed by its dStrong, each column is trimmed of surrounding
whitespace, and the dStrong column is split into the tag and its relation note
("a Name of", "a Meaning of", ...). No row is removed or edited.
